      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "At AWS, we believe AI builders should be able to choose the right model for every task, trust their agents in production, and see clearly what their AI workloads cost.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/icymi-what-landed-for-ai-builders-in-october-2026/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-11T22:26:40.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:12.482Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "What we shipped in October addresses each of these needs.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/icymi-what-landed-for-ai-builders-in-october-2026/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-11T22:26:40.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:12.482Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Amazon Bedrock and AgentCore updates keep agents available, hold them to the processes you define, and help you trust what they return.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/icymi-what-landed-for-ai-builders-in-october-2026/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-11T22:26:40.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:12.482Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Claude Haiku 5.5 is built for subagents and high-volume, cost-sensitive work.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/icymi-what-landed-for-ai-builders-in-october-2026/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-11T22:26:40.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:12.482Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In a multi-agent setup, a model such as Claude Opus 5.5 can plan the work and hand well-defined coding, tool use, and browser automation tasks to Haiku.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/icymi-what-landed-for-ai-builders-in-october-2026/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-11T22:26:40.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:12.482Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "OpenAI GPT-6.1 Terra is now generally available on Amazon Bedrock.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/icymi-what-landed-for-ai-builders-in-october-2026/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-11T22:26:40.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:12.482Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Amazon Nova 2.5 Sonic , our latest speech-to-speech model, improves reasoning, instruction following, and tool-calling accuracy, with lower latency at the same price as Amazon Nova 2 Sonic.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/icymi-what-landed-for-ai-builders-in-october-2026/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-11T22:26:40.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:12.482Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "GLM 5.3 by Z.ai is an open-weight model for agentic coding and long-horizon software engineering, with a 1-million-token context window and prompt caching, available to eligible enterprise customers.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/icymi-what-landed-for-ai-builders-in-october-2026/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-11T22:26:40.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:12.482Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Claude Haiku 5.5 and OpenAI GPT-5.6 models with cross-Region inference are now available in AWS GovCloud (US).",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/icymi-what-landed-for-ai-builders-in-october-2026/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-11T22:26:40.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:12.482Z"
      },
      {
